hrough an existing Claude subscription, so neither requires an API key; OpenAI/Anthropic base-URL overrides allow any compatible local or proxy endpoint.","source_file":"docs/translations/README.he-IL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_he_il_local_model_tuning","label":"Local-Model Tuning Flags (--token-budget, --max-concurrency, --api-timeout, OLLAMA_NUM_CTX, KEEP_ALIVE)","rationale":"Smaller chunks, fewer parallel calls and longer timeouts accommodate slow local models; unloading the model after each chunk saves VRAM on small GPUs.","source_file":"docs/translations/README.he-IL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_he_il_cluster_only","label":"graphify cluster-only","rationale":null,"source_file":"docs/translations/README.he-IL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_he_il_community_labeling","label":"Community Labeling (graphify label / --no-label)","rationale":"Inside an agent the agent names communities itself; on the bare CLI cluster-only auto-names them with the configured backend, with --no-label to keep generic \"Community N\" markers.","source_file":"docs/translations/README.he-IL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_he_il_force_flag","label":"--force Graph Overwrite","rationale":"Allows overwriting graph.json when the new graph has fewer nodes, needed after refactors or to clear ghost duplicates.","source_file":"docs/translations/README.he-IL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"author":null,"captured_at":null,"contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","id":"docs_translations_readme_he_il_global_g